      "extract": "SPECTRUM OF THE LAPLACIAN ON THE FRICKE-MACBEATH SURFACE CHUL-HEE LEE Abstract. The Fricke-Macbeath surface is the unique Hurwitz surface of genus 7 with 504 conformal automorphisms. In this paper, we prove that the first eigenvalue of the Laplacian on the Fricke-Macbeath surface has a sevenfold multiplicity and con- tained in the interval [1.23, 1.26]. Further, we numerically identify the 7-dimensional",
